⚠️ Prerequisite – Required Helper
This card requires a Number helper to define the total RAM size of the NAS.
The Buffalo API only exposes memory percentage, so total RAM must be declared manually.
Create the helper in Home Assistant:

Go to Settings → Devices & Services → Helpers
Click Add helper → Number
Configure it exactly as follows:

Name:          Buffalo Total RAM (GB)
Icon:          mdi:numeric
Initial value: 1
Minimum value: 0
Maximum value: 4
Step:          0.1
Mode:          Slider
Managed via UI: Yes

This helper will create:
input_number.buffalo_total_ram_gb
